-/** HST Office: rotating HASON TECH solution banner at the right end of the Tabbed notebookbar
-    of Writer, Calc and Impress (see docs/BANNERS.md, "Ribbon widget").
-
-    A plain VCL control owned by NotebookbarTabControl, which positions it beside the 2-row
-    groups and gives the groups the remaining width. Content comes from the UNO service
